<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Hartford Life initiated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Hartford Life initiated.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Edward D. Jones said Monday it initiated coverage of Hartford Life Inc with a strong buy rating.</p>
<p>The firm cited Hartford's broad distribution network, its leading market position in variable annuities and its well recognized &quot;Hartford&quot; brand name.</p>
<p>&quot;We believe the stock has significant upside potential over the next year as the company's annuity and mutual fund businesses continue to grow,&quot; the firm said in a report.</p>
<p>Hartford shares were up 1-1/2 at 35-3/8.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
